WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.494
Every prediction holds.

00:00:01.574 --> 00:00:08.540
Memorization plotted against input loss curvature
shows a strong linear trend on CIFAR100 and ImageNet,

00:00:08.620 --> 00:00:10.525
especially clean on ImageNet.

00:00:10.605 --> 00:00:14.972
Stronger privacy drives curvature down along the
predicted curve,

00:00:15.052 --> 00:00:17.435
and for the most-memorized examples,

00:00:17.515 --> 00:00:23.250
memorization rises with the privacy budget while
staying under the theoretical bound.
